# Spark engine (ROADMAP 7.0): the PySpark pipeline, its tests and the engine
# benchmark, without the training stack (no LightGBM, MLflow, ...).
# Locked with --constraint requirements.txt, so the libraries it shares with
# the DuckDB pipeline (pandas, numpy, pyarrow, duckdb) are the same versions.
# PySpark also needs a Java 17+ runtime, which pip can't install: see
# docs/pyspark.md (or use Dockerfile.spark, which has both).
